// ⚠️ 重要：怪物技能命名约定
// Monster Skill Naming Convention:
// - 所有怪物技能的 "id" 必须以 "monster_" 或 "enemy_" 开头
// - All monster skill IDs MUST start with "monster_" or "enemy_" prefix
// - 这是 SkillResolver 用于识别怪物技能的关键依据
// - This is how SkillResolver identifies monster skills
// 
// 示例：
// ✅ "monster_attack_basic" - 正确
// ✅ "monster_fire_breath" - 正确
// ✅ "enemy_poison_spit" - 正确
// ❌ "dragon_attack" - 错误！会被识别为玩家技能
// 
// 技能系统会根据前缀判断施法者类型：
// - monster_*/enemy_* → 使用怪物的 DamagePerHit、VariancePct
// - 其他 → 使用玩家的 DamagePerAttack、VariancePct
//
// Examples:
// ✅ "monster_attack_basic" - Correct
// ✅ "monster_fire_breath" - Correct  
// ✅ "enemy_poison_spit" - Correct
// ❌ "dragon_attack" - Wrong! Will be treated as player skill
//
// The skill system uses prefix to determine caster type:
// - monster_*/enemy_* → Uses monster's DamagePerHit, VariancePct
// - Others → Uses player's DamagePerAttack, VariancePct
